### Post-Tool Hooks (After Claude acts)

```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [{ "type": "command", "command": "npx biome check $FILE --write" }]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Use cases**:
- Auto-format after changes
- Run tests after edits
- Update checksums
